{{Factionpage|

| description = The Dark Reflection are followers of the Plaguebringer hidden deep in the Mines of Malfunction at the very back of Ak'Anon.  While most think of only the gnomish Necromancers, this guild has gnomish followers from many classes.  Evah Xokez leads the Clerics, Rilgor Plegnog the Enchanters, Vaenor Husga the Magicians, Eonis Mournunder the Necromancers, Kaxon Frennor the Rogues, Naygog Mitope the Warriors, and Velena Corgtec the Wizards.  This concentration of Evil makes the mines a very unsafe place for the forces of good.  '''Care should be taken not to harm the skeletons that roam the mines, for the wrath of these seven guildmasters is often swift and deadly.'''  The Dark Reflection is opposed by The Eldritch Collective and the Gemchoppers of Ak'Anon.

